  "item_short_desc": "<p>Conveniently carry all your essential tools and gear with our Mechanic's Tool Bag. The heavy-duty tool bag is the perfect place to store your essential tools and gear, such as screwdrivers, hammers, tape measures, levels, wrenches, pliers, jumper cables, and a variety of other equipment!</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "10730",
  "description": "<p>Conveniently carry all your essential tools and gear with our Mechanic's Tool Bag. The heavy-duty tool bag is the perfect place to store your essential tools and gear, such as screwdrivers, hammers, tape measures, levels, wrenches, pliers, jumper cables, and a variety of other equipment! These bags feature a zippered main compartment, 8 interior tool pocket organizers, and 2 exterior snap button pockets. Utility Pockets: In addition to the main compartment with a full-length zipper enclosure, neatly arrange your gear by utilizing the 8 interior tool pocket organizers that are great for frequently used items. On the other hand, the 2 exterior pockets offer a great storage solution for drill bits, hex keys, sockets (like the elusive 10mm), and even loose nails, hardware, and spare parts. Top Grade Canvas: Each utility bag is constructed with a heavyweight cotton canvas material that&rsquo;ll withstand constant use, be it on construction sites, various client locations, driveways, and even outdoor landscapes. These portable tool bags feature a hard bottom insert that&rsquo;ll support the weight of your tools and gear. Furthermore, the canvas dual carry handles are reinforced onto the bag with the dependable Box X stitch pattern. Must-Have for Any Trade: Keep your tools clean and dry in all kinds of work environments with one of our tool bag totes! Our ruggedly dependable tool bags are ideal for mechanics, plumbers, electricians, carpenters, masons, technicians, and many more! They&rsquo;re also great for homeowners or any DIYer that likes to tinker! For off-roaders and over-landers, they&rsquo;re awesome for carrying extra recovery gear and smaller spare parts! Portable &amp; Easy to Carry: These impervious canvas bags have an overall measurement of 11 inch x 7 inch x 6 inch, allowing you to comfortably store them in your workshop, garage, car, boat, or motorcycle&rsquo;s saddlebag. The dual carry handles provide for quick and easy access when you&rsquo;re on the go.</p>",
